{"availability":"available","full":"agenda/agenda","name":"agenda","description":"Lightweight job scheduling for Node.js","category":"Business","language":"HTML","stars":9709,"forks":844,"created":"2013-10-29T02:58:41Z","updated":"2026-07-21T07:56:40Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://agenda.github.io/agenda/","topics":["automated","cron","cronjob","crontab","frequency","interval","job","job-processor","job-scheduler","mongodb","nodejs","queue","recurring","runner","schedule","scheduler","task"],"demo":"https://agenda.github.io/agenda/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:57.692Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:57.692Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:57.692Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:57.692Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Node.js","url":"https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome-nodejs"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T11:13:28.133Z","stars":9708,"forks":845},{"at":"2026-10-09T13:17:59.157Z","stars":9709,"forks":845},{"at":"2026-10-10T13:03:27.975Z","stars":9709,"forks":844},{"at":"2026-10-16T08:20:14.285Z","stars":9709,"forks":844},{"at":"2026-10-17T05:16:57.692Z","stars":9709,"forks":844}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A light-weight job scheduling library for Node.js","Jobs are run with priority in a first in first out order (so they will be run in the order they were scheduled AND with respect to highest priority).","For example, if we have two jobs named \"send-email\" queued (both with the same priority), and the first job is queued at 3:00 PM and second job is queued at 3:05 PM with the same priority value, then the first job will run first if we start to send \"send-email\" jobs at 3:10 PM. However if the first job has a priority of 5 and the second job has a priority of 10, then the second will run first (priority takes precedence) at 3:10 PM."],"features":["Complete rewrite in TypeScript (fully typed!)","Pluggable backend - MongoDB by default, implement your own (see Custom Backend Driver)","Real-time notifications - Use Redis, PostgreSQL LISTEN/NOTIFY, MongoDB Change Streams (Native) or custom pub/sub","MongoDB 6 driver support","touch() with optional progress parameter (0-100)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agenda/agenda/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e6cae83471bfd2d4e4cf001f5d1d38912a1ae6d487f45ac175eea4adc0c504ae","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T11:13:28.133Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:57.762Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A light-weight job scheduling library for Node.js","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agenda/agenda/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e6cae83471bfd2d4e4cf001f5d1d38912a1ae6d487f45ac175eea4adc0c504ae","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agenda/agenda/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:57.764Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-21T07:56:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agenda/agenda/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T05:16:57.770Z","hash":"e6cae83471bfd2d4e4cf001f5d1d38912a1ae6d487f45ac175eea4adc0c504ae","originalBytes":71126,"storedBytes":71126,"truncated":false},"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:44.099Z","latestRelease":{"name":"agendash@8.2.4","tag":"agendash@8.2.4","publishedAt":"2026-07-21T05:04:37Z","url":"https://github.com/agenda/agenda/releases/tag/agendash%408.2.4"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:44.099Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/a6e0d6038819561d7558285e.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-14T13:51:16.951Z","url":"https://agenda.github.io/agenda/"}],"agentContextAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T11:16:33.740Z","agentContext":{"version":1,"checkedAt":"2026-10-07T11:16:37.400Z","documents":[{"name":"package.json","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agenda/agenda/blob/main/package.json","hash":"428cca78a572619acded2afcde739f2d9740f622ecc1d262490646a61292f320","originalBytes":868,"truncated":false},{